    "matches_existing": true,
    "text": "Daily and weekly vertical time series for the GNSS station RITE (Campi Flegrei), 2000-2024\r\n\r\nThe files contain a series of columns providing vertical displacement as a function of time:\r\nColumn 1: Time in Modified Julian Date\r\nColumn 2: Up displacement in meters\r\nColumn 3: Up uncertainty in meters\r\n\r\nPlease cite the following reference when using the dataset:\r\nDe Martino P, Dolce M, Brandi G, Scarpato G, Tammaro U (2021). \r\nThe Ground Deformation History of the Neapolitan Volcanic Area (Campi Flegrei Caldera, Somma\u2013Vesuvius Volcano, and Ischia Island) from 20 Years of Continuous GPS Observations (2000\u20132019).\r\nRemote Sensing. 13(14):2725. doi:10.3390/rs13142725.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
